# Soft Dawn — title / attract theme (4 bars). Wide lead, slow pad, gentle PCM swell.
deck 1
bpm 72

track Lead id lead gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 50 env_mode adsr vol 12
  gen attack 0.08 decay 0.3 sustain 10 release 0.4
  gen vib_rate 3 vib_amt 10
  note 60 0 2 v 100
  note 64 2 2 v 105
  note 67 4 2 v 110
  note 65 6 2 v 100
  note 64 8 2 v 105
  note 62 10 2 v 95
  note 60 12 2 v 100
  note 55 14 2 v 90

track Harm id harm gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 25 env_mode constant vol 5
  note 48 0 4 v 70
  note 52 4 4 v 75
  note 50 8 4 v 70
  note 48 12 4 v 80

track Bass id bass gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type wave wave_shape sine vol 12
  note 36 0 4 v 100
  note 40 4 4 v 95
  note 38 8 4 v 100
  note 36 12 4 v 110

track Swell id swell gen gbaDirectSound * 4
  gen waveform sine vol 9 bitcrush true
  adsr a 0.4 d 1.2 s 6 r 0.8
  note 72 1 3 v 70
  note 76 5 3 v 80
  note 74 9 3 v 75
  note 72 13 3 v 85
